parameters.toolDescription:
Runs ONE read-only PostgreSQL SELECT on the table document_rows (spreadsheet data):
  file_id text, file_name text, row_data jsonb   -- one row per spreadsheet row; the keys of row_data are the column headers
Tips: list sheets:   select file_name, count(*) from document_rows group by 1;
      see columns:   select distinct jsonb_object_keys(row_data) from document_rows where file_name ilike '%name%';
      read a value:  row_data->>'Column Name'      numbers: (row_data->>'Column Name')::numeric
Always add LIMIT 200 when returning rows.

parameters.query:
-- One row per question: when + pseudonymous person/chat hashes. Never the question text.
insert into usage_log (user_hash, chat_hash) values ($1, $2)
returning $3::text as "chatInput", $4::text as "sessionId";
